# Dict key names do not leak into sibling value scope as bare names.
# [k: "found"  v: 42] — the value 42 must not accidentally resolve to k's value.
# Guards against key names escaping into sibling scopes.
# After evaluation, v must be exactly Int(42), not String("found").
# Migrated from eval_dict.rs::test_dict_key_not_in_value_scope
[k: "found"  v: 42]
=== out
Dict({"k": String("found"), "v": 42})
